    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/264956ee68547b1f482f8203445a0b05.avif?t=1753200523\" /></div></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/c2cd76453d16adf69d1ae0a1db19979a.avif?t=1753200523\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start a Picnic solo or with up to three friends in online co-op! Strategize builds, complete objectives, and defeat monster hordes to prepare for massive boss battles! In the Zone, Loners that stick together survive. Sometimes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/47450813ffb8c15141344383e2c3cf1e.poster.avif?t=1753200523\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/47450813ffb8c15141344383e2c3cf1e.webm?t=1753200523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/47450813ffb8c15141344383e2c3cf1e.mp4?t=1753200523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/bbd79fed78f609ff5121289c16fde2f9.avif?t=1753200523\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your IMPULSE GEAR transforms every arena into a high-flying playground of destruction! Turn every ramp into a launchpad, every cliff into an advantage, and every mini-boss into easy pickings from above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/39601ffcc27384f74d5816b14b7e9bbc.poster.avif?t=1753200523\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/39601ffcc27384f74d5816b14b7e9bbc.webm?t=1753200523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/39601ffcc27384f74d5816b14b7e9bbc.mp4?t=1753200523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/2fd565b6c552d0473571869b8193c48f.avif?t=1753200523\" /></div>Shoot spirals of shurikens or blaze fiery Rocket  trails. Every upgrade combo creates harmonic chaos. Stack Cursed Curios, trigger evolutions, and rain explosive meteor storms on your enemies for devastating effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/52e38a7c9582812493b03500fa2201e7.poster.avif?t=1753200523\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/52e38a7c9582812493b03500fa2201e7.webm?t=1753200523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/52e38a7c9582812493b03500fa2201e7.mp4?t=1753200523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/b9da4bdfc56e749d6af7374929600888.avif?t=1753200523\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is still being developed, but we want to encourage everyone to participate! We have an active Discord server and would love to hear your feedback and questions!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/c2cd76453d16adf69d1ae0a1db19979a.avif?t=1753200523\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start a Picnic solo or with up to three friends in online co-op! Strategize builds, complete objectives, and defeat monster hordes to prepare for massive boss battles! In the Zone, Loners that stick together survive. Sometimes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/47450813ffb8c15141344383e2c3cf1e.poster.avif?t=1753200523\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/47450813ffb8c15141344383e2c3cf1e.webm?t=1753200523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/47450813ffb8c15141344383e2c3cf1e.mp4?t=1753200523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/bbd79fed78f609ff5121289c16fde2f9.avif?t=1753200523\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your IMPULSE GEAR transforms every arena into a high-flying playground of destruction! Turn every ramp into a launchpad, every cliff into an advantage, and every mini-boss into easy pickings from above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/39601ffcc27384f74d5816b14b7e9bbc.poster.avif?t=1753200523\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/39601ffcc27384f74d5816b14b7e9bbc.webm?t=1753200523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/39601ffcc27384f74d5816b14b7e9bbc.mp4?t=1753200523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/2fd565b6c552d0473571869b8193c48f.avif?t=1753200523\" /></div>Shoot spirals of shurikens or blaze fiery Rocket  trails. Every upgrade combo creates harmonic chaos. Stack Cursed Curios, trigger evolutions, and rain explosive meteor storms on your enemies for devastating effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/52e38a7c9582812493b03500fa2201e7.poster.avif?t=1753200523\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/52e38a7c9582812493b03500fa2201e7.webm?t=1753200523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/52e38a7c9582812493b03500fa2201e7.mp4?t=1753200523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1903560/extras/b9da4bdfc56e749d6af7374929600888.avif?t=1753200523\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is still being developed, but we want to encourage everyone to participate! We have an active Discord server and would love to hear your feedback and questions!</p>",
